Shows the status of the optical network terminal (ONT, fiber modem) in front
of the firewall: optical receive and transmit power, error counters,
firmware and serial number. A status page and a dashboard widget are
included. The plugin only reads from the ONT, unless the optional restart
button is enabled in its settings.

The ONT is queried on its management address, so the firewall needs an
interface in the ONT management network (for example 192.168.100.2/24 on
the WAN port, without gateway).

Supported devices:

* Deutsche Telekom Glasfaser-Modem 2 and 2b (driver "gfm2")

Further devices can be added as drivers, see the scripts/ont/drivers
directory.

